Privacy Policy

Last updated: 14/01/2026

This Privacy Policy describes how Master Reminder (“the App”, “we”, “us”, or
“our”) collects, uses, stores, and protects personal information when
you use the application available on the Google Play Store.

By using the App, you agree to the collection and use of information in
accordance with this Privacy Policy.

1.  Scope of This Policy This Privacy Policy applies solely to the
    mobile application Master Reminder and not to any third-party websites,
    services, or applications that may be linked from it.

2.  Information We Collect

2.1 Personal Information The App requires users to log in. As part of
this process, we may collect: - Name or username - Email address -
Authentication credentials (securely handled)

This information is used exclusively for authentication and access
control.

2.2 Document and Reminder Data The App allows users to store information
related to document expiration reminders, such as: - Document or paper
names - Expiration dates - Reminder preferences

This data is used solely to provide reminder functionality.

2.3 Technical Information We may collect limited technical information
including: - Device type and operating system version - App version -
Crash logs and diagnostic data

This information is used to maintain and improve the App.

3.  How We Use Your Information We use your information to:

-   Authenticate users
-   Manage document expiration reminders
-   Send notifications
-   Maintain app functionality
-   Comply with legal obligations

We do not use your data for advertising or marketing.

4.  Data Storage and Security We implement reasonable security measures
    to protect user data. However, no electronic storage method is
    completely secure.

5.  Data Sharing We do not sell or share personal data except when
    required by law or necessary for app operation.

6.  Notifications The App sends reminders for upcoming document
    expirations. Notifications can be disabled in device settings.

7.  Data Retention Data is retained only as long as necessary or until
    deletion is requested.

8.  Children’s Privacy The App is not intended for children under 13. We
    do not knowingly collect data from children.

9.  User Rights Users may request access, correction, or deletion of
    their data by contacting us.

10. Changes to This Policy We may update this policy from time to time.
    Changes are effective upon posting.

